
Building the executables

First define the path variable ${HOMEnwps} in your profile file, which points to the base of the code checked out

> export HOMEnwps=$(pwd)

Next, change directory to ${HOMEnwps}/sorc/, and execute the general NWPS install script. This single step will install the total
package, including all libraries and binary compilations:

> cd ${HOMEnwps}/sorc
> ./make_NWPS.sh > build_log.txt 2>&1

to make the code with debug flags:
./make_NWPS.sh check > build_log.txt 2>&1

Once the compilations are done, all executables are moved to ${HOMEnwps}/exec, and the system will be ready.

To clean your build simply run:
clean_NWPS.sh
